 "hast": "\n<p>The <a href=\"/docs/mcp\">shadcn MCP server</a> works out of the box with any shadcn-compatible registry. You do not need to do anything special to enable MCP support for your registry.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"prerequisites\">Prerequisites</h2>\n<p>The MCP server works by requesting your registry index. Make sure you have a registry item file at the root of your registry named <code>registry</code>.</p>\n<p>For example, if your registry is hosted at <code>https://acme.com/r/[name].json</code>, you should have a file at <code>https://acme.com/r/registry.json</code> or <code>https://acme.com/r/registry</code> if you're using a JSON file extension.</p>\n<p>This file must be a valid JSON file that conforms to the <a href=\"/docs/registry/registry-json\">registry schema</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"configuring-mcp\">Configuring MCP</h2>\n<p>Ask your registry consumers to configure your registry in their <code>components.json</code> file and install the shadcn MCP server:</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Tabs\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;defaultValue&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;claude&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsList\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;claude&#x22;}]\">Claude Code</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;cursor&#x22;}]\">Cursor</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;vscode&#x22;}]\">VS Code</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;codex&#x22;}]\">Codex</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;opencode&#x22;}]\">OpenCode</mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsContent\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;claude&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-4&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Configure your registry</strong> in your <code>components.json</code> file:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;registries&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;@acme&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com/r/{name}.json&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"registries\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"@acme\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com/r/{name}.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Run the following command</strong> in your project:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> mcp</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --client</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> claude</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Restart Claude Code</strong> and try the following prompts:</p><ul>\n<li>Show me the components in the acme registry</li>\n<li>Create a landing page using items from the acme registry</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Note:</strong> You can use <code>/mcp</code> command in Claude Code to debug the MCP server.</p></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsContent\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;cursor&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-4&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Configure your registry</strong> in your <code>components.json</code> file:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;registries&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;@acme&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com/r/{name}.json&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"registries\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"@acme\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com/r/{name}.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Run the following command</strong> in your project:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client cursor\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client cursor\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client cursor\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client cursor\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest mcp init --client cursor\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> mcp</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --client</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> cursor</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>Open <strong>Cursor Settings</strong> and <strong>Enable the MCP server</strong> for shadcn. Then try the following prompts:</p><ul>\n<li>Show me the components in the acme registry</li>\n<li>Create a landing page using items from the acme registry</li>\n</ul></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsContent\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;vscode&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-4&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Configure your registry</strong> in your <code>components.json</code> file:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;registries&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;@acme&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com/r/{name}.json&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"registries\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"@acme\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com/r/{name}.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Run the following command</strong> in your project:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client vscode\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client vscode\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client vscode\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client vscode\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest mcp init --client vscode\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> mcp</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --client</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> vscode</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>Open <code>.vscode/mcp.json</code> and click <strong>Start</strong> next to the shadcn server. Then try the following prompts with GitHub Copilot:</p><ul>\n<li>Show me the components in the acme registry</li>\n<li>Create a landing page using items from the acme registry</li>\n</ul></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsContent\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;codex&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-4&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Configure your registry</strong> in your <code>components.json</code> file:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;registries&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;@acme&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com/r/{name}.json&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"registries\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"@acme\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com/r/{name}.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Add the following configuration</strong> to <code>~/.codex/config.toml</code>:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"[mcp_servers.shadcn]\ncommand = &#x22;npx&#x22;\nargs = [&#x22;shadcn@latest&#x22;, &#x22;mcp&#x22;]\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">mcp_servers</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">shadcn</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">command = </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"npx\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">args = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"shadcn@latest\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"mcp\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">]</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Restart Codex</strong> and try the following prompts:</p><ul>\n<li>Show me the components in the acme registry</li>\n<li>Create a landing page using items from the acme registry</li>\n</ul></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsContent\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;opencode&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-4&#x22;}]\"><p><strong>Configure your registry</strong> in your <code>components.json</code> file:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;registries&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;@acme&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com/r/{name}.json&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"registries\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"@acme\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com/r/{name}.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Run the following command</strong> in your project:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client opencode\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client opencode\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client opencode\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client opencode\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest mcp init --client opencode\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> mcp</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --client</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> opencode</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>Restart OpenCode</strong> and try the following prompts:</p><ul>\n<li>Show me the components in the acme registry</li>\n<li>Create a landing page using items from the acme registry</li>\n</ul></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<p>You can read more about the MCP server in the <a href=\"/docs/mcp\">MCP documentation</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"best-practices\">Best Practices</h2>\n<p>Here are some best practices for MCP-compatible registries:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Clear Descriptions</strong>: Add concise, informative descriptions that help AI assistants understand what a registry item is for and how to use it.</li>\n<li><strong>Proper Dependencies</strong>: List all <code>dependencies</code> accurately so MCP can install them automatically.</li>\n<li><strong>Registry Dependencies</strong>: Use <code>registryDependencies</code> to indicate relationships between items.</li>\n<li><strong>Consistent Naming</strong>: Use kebab-case for component names and maintain consistency across your registry.</li>\n</ol>"
}
